GSA-PROJECT v1
{
  "path": "F:\\RPeGio\\Rust_Project\\AIGameSubtitleAssistant\\examples\\benchmark_examples\\moon_sisters.gsa",
  "video": "F:\\RPeGio\\Rust_Project\\AIGameSubtitleAssistant\\examples\\benchmark_examples\\quality_bench_test(voiced)_5min.mp4",
  "source_video": "F:\\RPeGio\\Rust_Project\\AIGameSubtitleAssistant\\examples\\benchmark_examples\\quality_bench_test_corpus(voiced)_5min.mp4",
  "name": "moon_sisters",
  "corpus": [
    {
      "id": "mtu7zkr021iovh",
      "text": "空月的航船中，浮现出了遥远过去的回忆…",
      "source": "ocr_track",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T14:55:00.300Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "mtu7zkr0wjncdk",
      "text": "卡侬\noo\n桑娜妲。仔细想想，最近这些年，你丢下工作，偷偷跑出去找人类玩的次数，好像越来越多\n了。",
      "source": "ocr_track",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T14:55:00.300Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "mtu7zkr0ux27a1",
      "text": "桑娜妲\n有、有什么关系嘛！工作丢给那些月使处理就可以了吧？",
      "source": "ocr_track",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T14:55:00.300Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "mtu7zkr085oib5",
      "text": "桑娜妲\n既然姐",
      "source": "ocr_track",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T14:55:00.300Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "mtu7zkr0x6d5tl",
      "text": "桑娜妲\n既然姐姐们看上的新主人愿意派手下分担我们的工作，那我也只好勉为其难地接受了！",
      "source": "ocr_track",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T14:55:00.300Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "mtu7zkr0wck536",
      "text": "桑娜妲\n更何况，卡侬姐姐不是也玩得很开心嘛！甚至都去参加人类的庆典了！",
      "source": "ocr_track",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T14:55:00.300Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "mtu7zkr00efyo3",
      "text": "卡侬\n…那是我本职工作的一部分。他们的主祭呼唤我的名字，我当然要回应他们的声音。",
      "source": "ocr_track",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T14:55:00.300Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "mtu7zkr03age44",
      "text": "艾莉亚\n嗯？假扮成普通人类少女，对着自己的神像跳舞也算是本职工作吗？",
      "source": "ocr_track",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T14:55:00.300Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "mtu7zkr0cwip7m",
      "text": "卡侬\n…艾莉亚。",
      "source": "ocr_track",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T14:55:00.300Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "mtu7zkr02ebk0t",
      "text": "艾莉亚\n卡侬妹妹。",
      "source": "ocr_track",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T14:55:00.300Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "mtu7zkr0tjchsd",
      "text": "卡侬\n…不是让你互叫名字算了。既然那位新来的月使对于帮桑娜妲处理工作这件事也没什么意\n见…",
      "source": "ocr_track",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T14:55:00.300Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "mtu7zkr013v181",
      "text": "艾莉亚\n兹白。她的名字是兹白。要好好记住别人的名字啦。",
      "source": "ocr_track",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T14:55:00.300Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "mtu7zkr0w46ds2",
      "text": "卡侬\n既然兹自没有意见，那我也不多说什么了。不过，",
      "source": "ocr_track",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T14:55:00.300Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "mtu7zkr0n0xgq9",
      "text": "卡侬\n既然兹白没有意见，那我也不多说什么了。不过，桑娜妲，作为月之意志，维系世界运转的\n术式基础是不能忘的。",
      "source": "ocr_track",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T14:55:00.300Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "mtu7zkr0xnb8ge",
      "text": "卡侬\n做好心理准备。我要给你出些验证态射同构的基础题目。直到全部算完为止，不许再到地上去",
      "source": "ocr_track",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T14:55:00.300Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "mtu7zkr04drrou",
      "text": "艾莉亚\n呵呵，真是坏心眼呢。简直就像是地上人的小说里，要把逃亡的公主抓回月亮上的反派一样。",
      "source": "ocr_track",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T14:55:00.300Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "mtu7zkr0g65fjc",
      "text": "桑娜妲\n就是就是！",
      "source": "ocr_track",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T14:55:00.300Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "mtu7zkr0oj52bo",
      "text": "卡侬\n…你自己就是月亮，不要说这种话。",
      "source": "ocr_track",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T14:55:00.300Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "mtu7zkr05m8iic",
      "text": "属于遥远过去的回忆消散了…",
      "source": "ocr_track",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T14:55:00.300Z"
    }
  ],
